silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_03_master_dag_concrete_anchor_6 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_master_dag #6', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'The Forge Master Graph' the bare symbol ObservedProfile anchors to MittensTraceFingerprint: The trace leg: an observable artifact that fires when the published claim is consumed downstream — a log line saying 'Mittens measurement-leg fetched 2024-04-12 by VetCarePlan_77.'." .
